{"route":"/karnal/services-top-interior-design-firm","city":"karnal","nested":false,"meta":{"og":{"type":"website","site_name":"9th-Corner","title":"Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal | 9th Corner","description":"9th Corner is a top interior design firm in Karnal with 22 years of experience designing homes, offices, salons and showrooms.","url":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-top-interior-design-firm","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg","image:width":"1200","image:height":"630"},"twitter":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal | 9th Corner","description":"9th Corner is a top interior design firm in Karnal with 22 years of experience designing homes, offices, salons and showrooms.","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg"},"title":"Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal | 9th Corner","robots":"index, follow","author":"9th-Corner","publisher":"9th-Corner","google-site-verification":"bFDxjFr1uDW3hEQ7YEzagKY9ZLzkrW1k1vtMcyQahyE","description":"9th Corner is a top interior design firm in Karnal with 22 years of experience designing homes, offices, salons and showrooms.","keywords":" Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal,Top interior design firm in Karnal for homes,Best affordable interior designers in Karnal,Budget-friendly interior design services in Karnal,Interior designers for small flats in Karnal,Best 2BHK interior design company in Karnal,Top interior designers for luxury apartments in Karnal,Modern home interior designers in Karnal,Best interior design firm for commercial spaces in Karnal,Interior designers for office remodeling in Karnal,Best modular kitchen interior designers in Karnal,Interior design company for 3BHK in Karnal,Interior designers for villa renovation in Karnal,Best turnkey interior design firm in Karnal,Interior designers offering 3D design in Karnal,Luxury interior designers Karnal,Interior decorators Karnal,Interior designing company Karnal,Home interior design Karnal,","theme-color":"#0f141f","canonical":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-top-interior-design-firm"},"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ninth Corner\",\"9th-Corner\"],\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"image\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"logo\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"description\":\"At our firm, we believe interior design is more than aesthetics—it’s about creating spaces that inspire, comfort, and reflect your unique personality. As a top interior design firm in Karnal, we deliver innovative and elegant solutions for residential, commercial, and luxury projects.\",\"telephone\":\"+91-9310582834\",\"email\":\"ninthcorner83@gmail.com\",\"priceRange\":\"$$$\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Pearls Best Heights I, 808, Netaji Subhash Place, Pitampura\",\"addressLocality\":\"Delhi\",\"postalCode\":\"110034\",\"addressRegion\":\"Delhi\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Karnal\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/ninthcornerINC\",\"https://www.instagram.com/9thcorner.interiors/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/9th-corner-int/\",\"https://youtube.com/@9thcorner\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Karnal\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-top-interior-design-firm\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#website\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":\"Ninth Corner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What should a top interior design firm in Karnal provide?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A clear design process, detailed drawings, transparent costs and supervision on site, with regular updates for clients who cannot visit often.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you take projects from Karnal and nearby cities?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Along with Karnal, we work across Delhi NCR. For other nearby cities, share your project location and we will plan the site visits with you.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you choose vendors for a project?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We work with vendors whose quality we have checked, and we can also supervise your own trusted vendors using our drawings.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why hire a top interior design firm for a business space?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A well-designed showroom, office or salon builds trust with customers and makes daily work easier for your staff.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal, Haryana\",\"serviceType\":\"Top Interior Design Firm\",\"description\":\"9th Corner is a top interior design firm in Karnal with 22 years of experience designing homes, offices, salons and showrooms.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-top-interior-design-firm\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Karnal, Haryana\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/bbb4.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Top Interior Design Firm in Karnal, Haryana</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>A Design Firm You Can Rely On in Karnal</h2>\n            <p>As the top interior design firm in Karnal, Haryana, we specialize in architecting innovative, elegant, and highly functional interiors across residential, commercial, and luxury sectors. Every project is a bespoke creation designed to reflect your unique personality and lifestyle, seamlessly merging high-end aesthetics with structural practicality. Through meticulous planning and creative vision, we bring your dream environment to life.</p>\n            <p>Hiring a top interior design firm from Delhi for a Karnal project raises fair questions. Who will supervise the site? How often will the designers visit? Will the work match the drawings? We answer these clearly before we start, and build our process around reliable delivery outside the metro.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Comprehensive Design Solutions for Every Project</h2>\n            <p>\"From modern luxury villas to corporate headquarters and high-traffic showrooms, we provide tailored design strategies that meet diverse functional requirements. Our team integrates global contemporary trends with premium materials to deliver spaces that are visually arresting and highly efficient.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Homes and Kothis</h3>\n                <p>Homes are drawn as one plan, from the entrance and drawing room to bedrooms, kitchen and bathrooms. Detailed drawings guide local craftsmen, and our supervisor makes sure they are followed.</p><p>Furniture, curtains and décor can be included for a complete, ready-to-live home.</p><p>We also coordinate with your civil contractor so interiors start as soon as the structure is ready.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Commercial and Institutional Projects</h3>\n                <p>Showrooms, offices, clinics and institutes need dependable timelines. As a top interior design firm, we schedule work around your opening hours, combine materials from Delhi with local supply, and hold the same standard across every floor.</p><p>Institutes and hospitals get finishes that are easy to sanitise and repair.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>How We Deliver Outside Delhi</h3>\n                <p>A supervisor stays on site every working day. Senior designers travel to Karnal at each key stage. You get photos every week. Samples are approved by you before materials are ordered. Work is checked after carpentry, after electrical work and after painting, and every pending point on the final list is fixed before we leave.</p><p>This keeps projects steady even when the design studio is a few hours away.</p><p><b>Innovative Concepts:</b> Developing avant-garde interior narratives that push the boundaries of traditional Haryana architecture while maintaining timeless elegance.</p><p><b>Premium Selection:</b> Curating high-end finishes, bespoke furniture, and architectural lighting that define the standards of luxury living in Karnal.</p><p><b>Flawless Execution:</b> As a top interior design firm, we keep a relentless focus on detail and precision engineering, ensuring that the final site handover perfectly matches the approved 3D visualization.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Our Project Stages</h3>\n                <p>We split the job into clear phases: understanding the brief, drawing the design, settling materials and money, building on site and handing over. Being a top interior design firm means each phase ends with your written approval before the next one starts.</p><p>Changes are always possible; we simply tell you what they will cost and how long they add before going ahead.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Clients in Karnal Trust Our Top Interior Design Firm</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>We know a project outside Delhi needs extra organisation. We plan ahead, communicate often and keep our promises on dates and quality. A single project manager is your contact throughout.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Elite Team of Interior Specialists with Extensive Haryana Expertise</strong>\n                    A specialised team with experience across Haryana.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Hyper-Tailored Solutions Aligned with Your Functional & Aesthetic Needs</strong>\n                    Plans fitted to your functional and design needs.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Hassle-Free End-to-End Project Management and Technical Delivery</strong>\n                    Managed delivery from start to final handover.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Full-Time Site Supervisor</strong>\n                    Someone on site every working day.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Senior Visits at Each Stage</strong>\n                    Quality checked by experienced designers.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Ready to redefine your environment? Partner with Karnal’s premier design firm to elevate your lifestyle today.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Haryana</h2>\n                <p>Recent work from our Haryana portfolio in Bhiwani and Gurgaon.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/1.avif\" alt=\"House in Gurgaon, Haryana by 9th Corner\" title=\"Gurgaon House\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/212.avif\" alt=\"Interior design in Sonipat, Haryana by 9th Corner\" title=\"Sonipat Interior\">\n         